wired into the Engine, the last boss.
- Phase 1, on her throne: four conduits shield her (she feels a tenth of every blow while one stands). The beam of her
  crown sweeps the hall (her crown glows first): hide behind the pillars. Her hounds of bronze climb out of the floor (two at most).
- Phase 2, risen: she walks, raises her trident (step back) and sweeps; she calls waves of the tide that roll across the
  hall (pass through the gap); the plates of the floor wake, pulsing in bands.
- Phase 3, the last tide: she pulls the player to her, sparks crackle around her, she slams rings of lightning.
She drops the Tide Crown. Her fall opens the lock of the Tide Road, in the dry harbor.
]]
